  <h2 id="demand-signal">Why India suddenly needs 25,000 actuaries</h2>

  <p>
    The demand story here is not vague optimism. It rests on three specific, checkable facts that
    together explain why a field with only 600-odd qualified professionals is treated as a genuine
    national skills gap.
  </p>

